            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nThis is a duplicate of several issues(the latest ones are #2014 and #1997), with conclusion that it is not a good idea (more details https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/978#issuecomment-2178081844).\n\nThere is a way to add \"choose item if it is single\" behavior to any picker, see [this](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1997#issuecomment-3274519620) comment.",
